data: {"type": "text_delta_finish", "role": "text", "content": "The documentation covers configuring Instagram-specific journeys and autoresponders:\n\n1. Open the **Welcome Journey** and **Fallback Journey**.\n2. Add a **Condition** action node immediately after the **Starting** node.\n3. Deselect `user_input`.\n4. Under **System variables**, select the `channel` variable.\n5. Use the channel condition to route Instagram users to the appropriate journey.\n\nThis allows Instagram to be handled alongside other channels. The available documentation does not specify the initial Instagram account-connection or credential steps.\n\nSource: `kb/channels/autoresponders.md`"}

