data: {"type": "text_delta_finish", "role": "text", "content": "In **Bot Studio**, add an **API Node** and configure the outbound request to your external endpoint. Use **Global** or **Local Variables** for dynamic values in the request.\n\nFor a reliable flow:\n\n1. Configure and test the API connection in the API Node.\n2. Store or reference dynamic inputs with variables.\n3. Add branches for expected HTTP responses\u2014especially success and failure cases such as `404` and `500`.\n4. Route error branches to fallback messages or recovery steps.\n5. Test the full journey in **Test Bot** before publishing.\n\nUse a **JSON Handler** to parse API responses, then a **Condition Node** to branch based on returned values.\n\n[See it in action: Bot Studio](https://demoforge-ui.gupshup.io/shared/adca6f42-7fc6-4f03-bf26-f5123e16071c/autoplay)"}

